{
  "_meta.title": "六请求头 golden 样例(X-SIGNATURE / Authorization / X-RISK-BASIC 等)",
  "_meta.generator": "scripts/GenVectors.java(JDK11 + bcprov-jdk15on 1.70,确定性可重跑)",
  "_meta.notes": [
    "六个头见 RiskSimpleClient.buildHeaders(L298-L307):Content-Type/X-RISK-MODE/X-SIGNATURE/Authorization/X-RISK-BASIC/X-User-Id",
    "X-SIGNATURE = 标准 Base64( ECIES(staticPub, 小写hex(sha512(升序JSON))) ):被加密的是 128 个 ASCII hex 字符本身",
    "Authorization = \"Basic \" + Base64UrlWithPadding(clientId + ':' + clientSecret);这不是标准 Basic 的字母表(+/ 被换成 -_),【带填充 =】",
    "X-RISK-BASIC = Base64UrlWithPadding(headerJson),URL-safe 同样带填充",
    "X-User-Id:risk 场景来自 basicParam.getUserId()(缺省 UNKNOWN);案件查询硬编码 UNKNOWN",
    "三条样例分别覆盖:案件查询 7 键签名 / 同步问询含密文 19 键签名 / 非 ASCII bizId"
  ],
